# ct_measure.mlgi - Carl Gable's tet quality attributes (ex_id_tet_types),
# computed on a copy of mesh object MO and written to AVS_OUT.
cmo / copy / mo_m / MO
cmo / select / mo_m
cmo / addatt / mo_m / ang_mind / ang_mind
cmo / addatt / mo_m / ang_maxd / ang_maxd
cmo / addatt / mo_m / ang_maxd_solid / s_maxd
cmo / addatt / mo_m / ang_mind_solid / s_mind
quality / edge_ratio / y
quality / aspect / y
dump / avs / AVS_OUT / mo_m
cmo / delete / mo_m
cmo / select / MO
finish
